    "media:imagetext": "SAN FRANCISCO - TOKYO\nWESTERN\nAmuse-Gueule\nBay Shrimp with Lemon\nAppetizer\nSmoked Salmon\nSalad\nFresh Salad / Thousand Island Dressing\nMain Dish (Choice)\nFillet of Beef with Herb Butter\nChateau Potatoes / Green Beans / Carrots\n(677 kcal.)\nJAL Healthy Menu Selection *\nFillet of Sea Bass with Lemon Dill Sauce\nBroccoli / Green Beans / Carrots\nSpecial Bread or Steamed Rice\nDried seafood \u0026 vegetable powder topping \"FURIKAKE\"\nfor steamed rice also available.\nDessert Wagon (Choice)\nFrench Pastries / Fresh Fruits\nCheese / Chocolate\nCoffee\nBeverage\nTea\nGreen Tea\n*JAL Healthy Menu Selection... Light and well-balanced dish which is low in fat and salt.\n• SEASONS EXPRESS MENU •\nIf you prefer to eat according to your schedule.\nplease consult vour cabin attendant.\nWe apologize if occasionally your choice is not available.\nSAN FRANCISCO - TOKYO\nJAPANESE\nAppetizer\nGrilled Beef with \"Miso'\nSmoked Salmon \"Sushi\"\nPumpkin Mousse\nPan-fried Burdock in Soy Sauce\nYakimono\nGrilled Salmon with Light Soy Sauce\nNimono\nBraised Vegetables\nDainomono\nBraised Beef \"Sukiyaki\" Style\nKobachi\nEgg Custard\nMiso Soup\nSteamed Rice\nDried seafood \u0026 vegetable powder topping \"FURIKAKE'\nfor steamed rice also available.\nDessert Wagon (Choice)\nFrench Pastries / Fresh Fruits\nCheese / Chocolate\nCoffee\nBeverage\nTea\nGreen Tea\n• SEASONS EXPRESS MENU •\nIf you prefer to eat according to your schedule,\nplease consult your cabin attendant.\nWe apologize if occasionally your choice is not available",
